---
// src/components/Journey.astro
// The Journey section - showing the development process of RestOh
---

<section id="journey" class="py-20 bg-bg-secondary">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-5xl">

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-center mb-4">
      The Journey
    </h2>
    <p class="text-fg-secondary text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      RestOh wasn't built in a day. It evolved through a deliberate, professional process.
    </p>

    <!-- Timeline -->
    <div class="relative">
      <!-- Vertical line -->
      <div class="absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-border"></div>

      <!-- Phase 1: Study -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-bg-tertiary border border-border z-10 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <span class="text-2xl">📚</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-16 md:text-right mt-4 md:mt-0 ml-20 md:ml-0">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-accent mb-2">Phase 1: Study</h3>
          <p class="text-fg-secondary">
            Starting point: an open-source Node.js backend. Interesting concept, but incomplete.
            I studied its architecture, identified what worked, what didn't, and what was missing.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 2: Prototype -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start mb-16">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-bg-tertiary border border-border z-10 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🎨</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pl-16 md:ml-auto mt-4 md:mt-0 ml-20 md:ml-0">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-accent mb-2">Phase 2: Prototype</h3>
          <p class="text-fg-secondary mb-4">
            A full React frontend simulating every feature — menu, cart, interactive table reservations, admin dashboard.
            No backend yet, but the complete UX of the final product.
          </p>
          <a href="https://cb-restoh-flyer.pages.dev/"
             target="_blank"
             rel="noopener noreferrer"
             class="inline-flex items-center text-accent hover:text-accent-hover transition-colors">
            Explore the Prototype
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Phase 3: MVP -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-accent/20 border-2 border-accent z-10 md:absolute md:left-1/2 md:-translate-x-1/2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🚀</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2 md:pr-16 md:text-right mt-4 md:mt-0 ml-20 md:ml-0">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-accent mb-2">Phase 3: Production MVP</h3>
          <p class="text-fg-secondary mb-4">
            Backend rebuilt from scratch with security-first architecture.
            Every feature refined, tested, and production-ready.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-fg-secondary text-sm space-y-1 mb-4 md:text-right">
            <li>✓ OWASP-compliant security</li>
            <li>✓ 2,000+ automated tests</li>
            <li>✓ 84% backend coverage</li>
            <li>✓ Docker + CI/CD ready</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 md:justify-end">
            <a href="#"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 bg-accent text-bg-primary font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed"
               aria-disabled="true">
              Try Live Demo
              <span class="ml-2 text-xs">(Coming Soon)</span>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ChristopheBouriel"
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer"
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 border border-border rounded-lg hover:border-accent hover:text-accent transition-colors">
              View Code
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Quote -->
    <p class="text-fg-tertiary text-center mt-16 italic max-w-xl mx-auto">
      "Sometimes the best way to build something solid is to start with something imperfect — and transform it, one test at a time."
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
